t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>12</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decoration</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.5.0\" title=\"Version 1.5.0\">v.1.5.0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"<b>Nom! Delicious. Don't hop away!</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"><b>Description</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Chocolate Bunny</b> was sold as a decoration for 12 eggs during the Easter Event.\n</p><p>Upon using the \"<i>Eat Chocolate</i>\" prompt, the player shrinks to a smaller scale.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\"><b>History</b></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.5.0\" title=\"Version 1.5.0\">Version 1.5.0</a>, on the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals\" title=\"Eggcelent Deals\">Eggtastic Hop Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals\" title=\"Eggcelent Deals\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, the price has been changed from <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>35 to $1,600;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from $1,600 to <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>12.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163106\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 sec